post.doc:
Make an HTTP POST request.

Arguments:
	url (str): Target URL.
	body (str|bytes|nil): Request body payload.
	options (thing|nil): Optional extra settings such as `headers` or `params`.

Example:
	requests.post('https://example.org', 'raw body', {
		headers: [['Content-Type', 'text/plain']]
	});

get.doc:
Make an HTTP GET request.

Arguments:
	url (str): Target URL.
	options (thing|nil): Optional extra settings such as `headers` or `params`.

Example:
	requests.get('https://example.org', {
		params: [['arg', '123']],
		headers: [['Accept', 'application/json']]
	});
